<!DOCTYPE html>
@* Dark-first: ZWarden boots with .dark applied (style-guide.md); light stays first-class. *@
<html lang="en" class="dark">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <base href="/" />
    @* Blueprint's component CSS (pre-built, in @layer bb). *@
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="_content/BlazorBlueprint.Components/blazorblueprint.css" />
    @* ZWarden's own Tailwind output - generated by `npm run build:css`, committed,
       and diffed by CI (ADR 0003). Forgetting to regenerate it is a SILENT failure:
       the utility class is simply absent and the layout does not apply. *@
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="@Assets["app.css"]" />
    <ImportMap />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="favicon.png" />
    @* Per-page interactivity (not global): pages are static-rendered by default so the
       Account auth surface can sign the cookie on a real HTTP request (issue #63); a page
       opts into a circuit with `@@rendermode InteractiveServer`. *@
    <HeadOutlet />
</head>

<body>
    <Routes />
    <script src="@Assets["_framework/blazor.web.js"]"></script>
</body>

</html>
